            "sid": "NEH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kasodi abunore mama ejaas lukibukui lukokekwa juwai, kainak kes ibaluan luka ekabaka. Abu ekabaka keyakiarite eoŋ nepepe ka ikapolok luka ajore ka ikebwanenok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepuput Sanabalat Ekoronit, ka Tobia ekejaanakinan, Emonait, kokadakis kesi noi, naarai ebunit etuŋanan atamakin aisigalikin idwe luka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
