              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam ikapolok apotu koienutu kwape abu kalosio, karaida nuabu keswama; kwabo mam ber alimokinit Iyudayan, karaida isasedotin, karaida isotia, karaida ikayaitok, karaida ice kere lueswamaete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
