            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kalimok kes kwape ejaar akan nakaiokan naka Ekadeke keoŋ; ka akiro da nuka ekabaka nuabu kalimok eoŋ. Kobalas ebe, “Kanyoutu, kaduko.” Kosodete kitogogonoto akecekanin kanuka aswam ŋin naejok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
